{"3935200": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "North Pole Workshop", "steam_appid": 3935200, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >North Pole Workshop is a first-person toy-making, throwing, and delivery game for 1-4 players co-op. Haul wood and other crafting materials into magical machines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magical machines that create adorable toys, like dolls, teddies, rocking horses, and many others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT TOYS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/04a472535eeec09e378d28beba9cc911.poster.avif?t=1785793315\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/04a472535eeec09e378d28beba9cc911.webm?t=1785793315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/04a472535eeec09e378d28beba9cc911.mp4?t=1785793315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw the wrapped toys into Santa's Sleigh before time runs out and earn more stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELIVER TO SANTA'S SLEIGH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/6848807a16ff2edc306030b7e0a29946.poster.avif?t=1785793315\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/6848807a16ff2edc306030b7e0a29946.webm?t=1785793315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/6848807a16ff2edc306030b7e0a29946.mp4?t=1785793315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Santa make toys inside magical workshops! Pick up, throw, and transport raw materials into magical machines that make many different kinds of toys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 players. Play solo, split-screen multiplayer, or online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and go for one-star levels of production, go a little faster for two-star, or go really fast and find efficiencies to reach the pinnacle of three-star production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on a pair of shoes that make you run faster, or try the pair that makes you jump higher, or a pair that makes you throw farther.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new machines, new locations, and new toys as you progress through the magical production in the North Pole Workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels and earn more stars to unlock new decorations in your starting hub area, such as furniture, tree decorations, cookies, and more! </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >North Pole Workshop is a first-person toy-making, throwing, and delivery game for 1-4 players co-op. Haul wood and other crafting materials into magical machines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magical machines that create adorable toys, like dolls, teddies, rocking horses, and many others.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CRAFT TOYS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/04a472535eeec09e378d28beba9cc911.poster.avif?t=1785793315\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/04a472535eeec09e378d28beba9cc911.webm?t=1785793315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/04a472535eeec09e378d28beba9cc911.mp4?t=1785793315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw the wrapped toys into Santa's Sleigh before time runs out and earn more stars!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELIVER TO SANTA'S SLEIGH</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/6848807a16ff2edc306030b7e0a29946.poster.avif?t=1785793315\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/6848807a16ff2edc306030b7e0a29946.webm?t=1785793315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/extras/6848807a16ff2edc306030b7e0a29946.mp4?t=1785793315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help Santa make toys inside magical workshops! Pick up, throw, and transport raw materials into magical machines that make many different kinds of toys.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1-4 players. Play solo, split-screen multiplayer, or online multiplayer.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax and go for one-star levels of production, go a little faster for two-star, or go really fast and find efficiencies to reach the pinnacle of three-star production.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put on a pair of shoes that make you run faster, or try the pair that makes you jump higher, or a pair that makes you throw farther.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new machines, new locations, and new toys as you progress through the magical production in the North Pole Workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete levels and earn more stars to unlock new decorations in your starting hub area, such as furniture, tree decorations, cookies, and more! </p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Play as one of Santa’s elves to create, gift-wrap, and deliver toys. This 1-4 cooperative toy-making game can be completed at your own pace in easy difficulty (1 star). But if you really want to impress Santa or test how well your group works together, you can attempt the harder timed difficulties.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/876de6a87c59ee7619d7e5b090be795a5228fd93/header.jpg?t=1785793315", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/edf575eea01fce3c2b58a76058d8375fb7ba2ac8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785793315", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3935200/edf575eea01fce3c2b58a76058d8375fb7ba2ac8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785793315", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10 (64 Bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 10100TE (Q2 2020), Intel Core i5 7400 (Q1 2017), AMD Ryzen™ 3 1300X (Q3 2017) AMD Ryzen™ 5 PRO 2500U (Q1 2019), Intel Core i7 8650U (Q3 2017)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1060 6GB, NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 Mobile 6GB, AMD Radeon RX 5600M 6GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br